 ## Abstract
 
-We report a separation between category-sensitive localization and relational object selection in evaluated CLIP pipelines. A map that highlights a category need not identify the intended instance among objects of that category. We analyze saved COCO experiments with a frozen ViT-B/16, ordinary and modified final-block readouts, and released Dense Cosine Similarity Map (DCSM) scorers. At 224-pixel input resolution, a ClearCLIP-style readout increases proposal-based detection AP from 2.6 to 27.3 on 4,952 images, yet its mean-map scorer obtains 39.4% balanced spatial-selection accuracy, versus 50.3% for the ordinary readout. On 527 spatial queries from 375 images, released DCSM ObjA and COCO scorers reach 58.1% [53.7, 62.4] and 57.3% [53.2, 61.2], respectively, against 45.7% expected chance. These conditional, annotation-derived results motivate separate validation of localization and relational selection; they neither isolate a causal mechanism nor test learned DCSM scoring on modified features.
+We report a separation between category-sensitive localization and relational object selection in evaluated CLIP pipelines. A map that highlights a category need not identify the intended instance among objects of that category. We analyze saved COCO experiments with a frozen ViT-B/16, ordinary and modified final-block readouts, and released Dense Cosine Similarity Map (DCSM) scorers. At 224-pixel input resolution, a ClearCLIP-style readout increases proposal-based detection AP from 2.6 to 27.3 on 4,952 images, yet its mean-map scorer obtains 39.4% balanced spatial-selection accuracy, versus 50.3% for the ordinary readout. On 527 spatial queries from 375 images, released DCSM ObjA and COCO scorers reach 58.1% [53.7, 62.4] and 57.3% [53.2, 61.2], respectively, against 45.7% expected chance (exploratory percentile 95% image-cluster bootstrap intervals). These conditional, annotation-derived results motivate separate validation of localization and relational selection; they neither isolate a causal mechanism nor test learned DCSM scoring on modified features.
 
